{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA306487","title":"Bacterial structure of the WWTP activated sludge and incoming sewage with different chemical composition","description":"Activated sludge (AS) plays a crucial role in treatment of domestic and industrial wastewater. AS is a biocenosis of microorganisms capable to degrade various pollutants including organic compounds, toxins and xenobiotics. We performed 16S rRNA gene sequencing of AS and incoming sewage in three wastewater treatment plants (WWTPs) responsible for processing of sewage with different origin: municipal wastewater, slaughterhouse and refinery sewage.","center":"Engelhards Institute of Molecular Biology","data_type":"Targeted loci environmental","submission_date":"2015/12/18 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN04348378","16S rRNA genes sequencing (City.Dec.AS.r1)","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2013-10-23",2013,"RU","Moscow",524901,"Moscow","probable",55.7495,37.6251,"Russia: Moscow region",null,"activated sludge(ENVO:00002046)","activated sludge","activated sludge","explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMN04348507","City.Dec.AS.r2","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2013-12-20",2013,"RU","Moscow",524901,"Moscow","probable",55.7495,37.6251,"Russia: Moscow region",null,"wastewater treatment plant(ENVO:00002043)","activated sludge(ENVO:00002046)","activated sludge(ENVO:00002046)","explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMN04348508","City.Dec.IW.r1","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2013-12-20",2013,"RU","Moscow",524901,"Moscow","probable",55.7495,37.6251,"Russia: Moscow region",null,"wastewater treatment plant(ENVO:00002043)","activated sludge(ENVO:00002046)","activated sludge(ENVO:00002046)","explicit urban setting at sample 